==Battleground==
*3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 21.33~25.33 seconds<sup>640f~760f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'noir]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 21.33~25.33 seconds<sup>640f~760f</sup>.
*3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 21.33~25.33 seconds<sup>640f~760f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The primary challenge in this level is using the limited money effectively. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] are both invaluable here. Use them alongside cheap meatshields and many [[Cat Combo|Combos]], as there is little point in having much variety in units.

Le'noir is the biggest threat; if you knockback Bun Bun Black too much, you run the risk of your attackers walking into Le'noir's range and dying instantly, leaving you with no more money to work with. Instead of trying to rush down Bun Bun Black, use him as a "stepping stone" for [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance]]/[[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave]]/[[:Category:Surge Attack Cats|Surge Attackers]].

